{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は走れ！bicycle最後の全国握手会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/1799758/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までで一番くらいにたくさんの方が来てくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブはみなさんのパワーに負けないくらい頑張ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/1799758/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛り上がりましたねっ(*^□^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援とかサイリウムの波がすっごくきれいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに支えてもらえているなんて幸せだと感じました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日やった曲は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人はなぜ走るのか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙がまだ悲しみだった頃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音が出ないギター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかちなかたつむり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！bicycle"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会は応援してもらえたり、ちょいとふざけたりもできて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だんだんみなさんと自然に会話できるようになったかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて思います(o^∀^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく緊張するって言われることがあるんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も最初は少し緊張してるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でも聞きたいことあったら質問とかしちゃってください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/1799758